-- Streambox reference data
--
-- Catalogue and configuration rows a fresh environment needs to boot into a usable app:
-- themes, streaming provider configs, announcements, and the franchise catalogue, plus
-- the two storage buckets.
--
-- Explicitly NOT included: any user data. No auth.users, profiles, settings, watch
-- history, library entries, episode progress, watch rooms or audit logs. Restoring user
-- data is a backup concern, not a seed concern.
--
-- Every statement is ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING (buckets: DO UPDATE on their limits), so this
-- file never overwrites live rows and is safe to re-run.
--
-- Generated from production 2026-07-28.

